/* =========================================================
 * 7 SEGMENT
 * PB0 = a
 * PB1 = b
 * PB2 = c
 * PB3 = d
 * PB4 = e
 * PB5 = f
 * PB6 = g
 *
 * Common Anode:
 * LOW  = ON
 * HIGH = OFF
